{% import 'landing/sections/_shot.html.twig' as shot %}

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ DRESSING ROOM ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="dressing-room" class="depth-section">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Dressing Room Dynamics</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Your squad has opinions about each other.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
            Every player carries a live relationship with every team-mate. Bonds form
            between players who train together, room together and win together; friction
            builds between the ones who don't. The network is visible, and it moves.
        </p>

        <div class="leagues-inner" style="margin-top:40px;">
            <div>
                <div class="depth-list">
                    <div class="depth-item">
                        <span class="depth-item-title glow-mint">Bonded</span>
                        <p>Solid green links. Bonded players lift each other's morale week on week and hold form through a bad run.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="depth-item">
                        <span class="depth-item-title" style="color:var(--red);">Friction</span>
                        <p>Dashed red links. Friction drags morale down, and a dressing room carrying enough of it will turn on a manager.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="depth-item">
                        <span class="depth-item-title">Unformed</span>
                        <p>Most of the squad, most of the time. Relationships are earned, not assigned at signing — a new arrival starts connected to nobody.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="depth-item">
                        <span class="depth-item-title">It compounds</span>
                        <p>Sell the wrong player and you cut three bonds at once. The squad you build is a network, not a list.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <figure class="ss-frame">
                    {{ shot.img('dressing-room-network', 'Dressing room overview — squad rated SETTLED, 24% bonded, 76% unformed, 0% friction, average morale 99, with a relationship network mapping links between eleven named players') }}
                    <figcaption class="ss-caption">Key relationship network — tap a face for scores</figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
